  <issue>
  Investigate how to stream output from Tool calls in Agents
As @mathislucka has worked with Agents he has found that streaming Tool calls to be extremely helpful for transparency and visibility. It allows users to see what is happening while they wait for a final answer and can make it easier to debug by seeing where the Agent may have made an incorrect decision. 

So it would be worthwhile if we could investigate whether we could easily stream the output of tool calls similar as to what we do for our ChatGenerators. 

@mathislucka please add any additional relevant context. 

It would be great to support streaming for:
- ToolCall: Stream that the LLM decided to make a tool call along with its arguments
- ToolCallResult: Stream/dump the output of the Tool
  </issue>
  
